+
+I found no materially unsound reachable rule and therefore make no unsoundness allegation. Consistent with the required standard, no rule is called unsound without a concrete or symbolic false-conclusion witness. Stage 5 passes.
+
+## 6. Fresh non-vacuity test
+
+I did not reuse the candidate's `spec-vacuity.k`. The reviewer-authored [audit-vacuity.k](evidence/audit-vacuity.k) loads the exact submitted program, uses the satisfying concrete input `[1,2,3,4]`, retains the correct sum 10, and changes only the result-constraining product obligation from the demonstrably correct 24 to the false 25.
+
+First, a dry run parsed and compiled it successfully:
+
+```bash
+kprove audit-vacuity.k --definition audit-verification-kompiled \
+  --spec-module AUDIT-VACUITY --dry-run --warnings none
+# exit 0
