  ✓ Rebuild definitions from source and independently run all positive proof claims
  ✓ Review claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and concrete satisfying states
  ✓ Inventory and assess every syntax/function/semantic/proof rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation for non-vacuity
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md with verdict
